Morning chill awakens you. Of course, fire by the entrance is long diminished. You're very lucky, that nobody else was interested in you during the night.
Your friends sleep side by side in a row, embracing each other to keep warm. You wake them up. The hood of Irene's cloak was smeared in clay, Doyle's hair stood on end, but in general everyone was in good spirits.
After discussing once again what happened yesterday and eating a piece of bread, found in the bag, you decided to keep going. It's time to get out of this forest. 